					"title": "Preserve the existing retry-delay schedule",
					"text": "🟡 **Medium**\n\n**Preserve the existing retry-delay schedule**\n\n**Required:** This also changes the delay schedule, beyond skipping the final delay. Previously, after the first failure (`attempt === 0`), the retry proceeded after `sleep(0)`; now it waits `baseDelayMs` before the second invocation. For example, with `maxAttempts: 2` and `baseDelayMs: 100`, this adds a 100 ms delay that was not present before. Keep the original multiplier while retaining the `isLastAttempt` guard so this fix does not introduce a timing regression.\n\n*Suggested fix:*\n\n```suggestion\n        await sleep(options.baseDelayMs * attempt);\n```"
				}
